   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> replace <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_03313\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_03313]</a></span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">template &lt;class T&gt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_BasicString_b75ad8.html#SWS_CORE_03022\">BasicString</a> &amp; replace (<a href=\"#SWS_CORE_03012\">size_type</a> pos1, <a href=\"#SWS_CORE_03012\">size_type</a> n1, const T &amp;t, <a href=\"#SWS_CORE_03012\">size_type</a> pos2, <a href=\"#SWS_CORE_03012\">size_type</a> n2=<a href=\"#SWS_CORE_00073\">npos</a>);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>As per corresponding usage in [basic.string] except for the following deviations: 1. charT replaced with value_type 2. if ( pos1 &gt; size() || pos2 &gt; sv.size() ) IsoStdOutOfRangeViolation is raised instead of std::out_of_range</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
